    "title": "Mars Climate Sounder Surface Temperatures Corrected to 03:00 and 15:00 LTST",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17947556",
    "publication_date": "2025-12-16",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains surface temperature observations derived from the Mars Climate Sounder (MCS). The data has been processed to correct for observational time offsets, normalizing all measurements to nominal Local True Solar Times (LTST) of 03:00 and 15:00.</p>\n<p>The dataset is provided in .nc format. The files contain the following variables:<br>MY: Mars Year<br>Ls : Solar Longitude.<br>Lon: Longitude.<br>Lat: Latitude.<br>ltst: The local time of observation.<br>tsurf_correct: The corrected surface temperature normalized to nominal local time.</p>",
